Transmutation Spheres act like Relics, granting three actions. Spheres last 30 seconds once on the ground, start with 30 ammo on pickup, and drain at a rate of 1 ammo per second. Dropping a Sphere despawns it.

Spheres are Generic Void Weapons. They benefit from Empowering and Void-Verb Buffs, but are unaffected by nor trigger Ability, Trace Rifle, or Weapon Surge effects.

• Light Attacks deal <pve 300 /> <pvp [150] /> damage, disorient combatants, and cost 1 ammo. Can attack twice per second. Airborne attacks deal 25% reduced damage.

• Heavy Attacks consume the sphere, slamming it on the ground for <pve 1500 /> <pvp [300] /> damage, and <void/>Suppress in a 5 meter radius with no falloff regardless of ammo.

• Guarding projects a draining field in a 5 meter radius. This disorients enemies, deals <pve 30 /> <pvp [12] /> damage to lifesteal 5 HP every 0.3 seconds, and grants <pve 80% /> <pvp [50%] /> damage resistance and knockback immunity.

Guarding drains 1 ammo every 0.25 seconds, slowing at 3 ammo and halting on the final round. Guarding at 1 ammo deals increasingly lethal self-damage every 0.7 seconds until you stop or die.

